    "long_instructions": "# Modify C\r\nThis program paints 4 squares, but the code is pretty repetitive.\r\n\r\n**Do This:** \r\n\r\n1. Refactor the repeated `take_paint()` commands into a `while` loop that uses `is_on_bucket()` as the condition.\r\n2. Replace the four repeated painting blocks with a counting variable and a `while` loop that runs 4 times.",
